Dependency layering (plan/architecture.md §3)

crate                        layer          workspace deps
cadcraft                     exempt         engine, io, mcp, ui-egui
cadcraft-cli                 exempt         engine, io, mcp, render
cadcraft-color               L0             
cadcraft-constraints         L2             doc, geom
cadcraft-doc                 L1             color, geom
cadcraft-dwg                 L0 standalone  
cadcraft-dxf                 L0 standalone  
cadcraft-engine              L4             color, constraints, doc, dxf, fonts, geom, render, io (dev)
cadcraft-fonts               L2             geom
cadcraft-geom                L0             
cadcraft-io                  L3             color, doc, dwg, dxf, fonts, geom, render
cadcraft-mcp                 L5             engine, io, render
cadcraft-render              L2             color, doc, fonts, geom
cadcraft-ui-egui             L5             color, doc, engine, fonts, geom, render
cadcraft-web                 exempt         engine, io, ui-egui
xtask                        exempt         

OK: 16 crates, no layering violations.
